    {
      "id": 7047826309192,
      "title": "Apex Trio Herbal Blend",
      "handle": "apex-trio-herbal-blend",
      "body_html": "<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"140\">Black Walnut Hull + Wormwood + Clove</p>\n<p data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"477\">A traditional herbal blend formulated with three powerful botanicals historically used to support intestinal cleansing and microbial balance. This concentrated tincture is designed to complement gut protocols by helping create an internal environment that is less hospitable to unwanted organisms while supporting digestive function.</p>\n<p data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"477\">Add 1 tsp of dried herbs to 1 cup of water.\u00a0 Bring to a boil, remove from heat and let steep for 10 - 15 minutes.</p>\n<p data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"477\">Take on an empty stomach or between meals.</p>\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"957\">This traditional trio works together to provide targeted herbal support:</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"992\">Supports parasite cleansing</strong> using botanicals historically used for intestinal organisms</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1087\">Promotes microbial balance</strong> within the digestive tract</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1159\">Provides concentrated herbal potency</strong> in an easy-to-use liquid form</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1225\">Supports digestive function</strong> during cleansing protocols</p>\n<p data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1451\">Black walnut hull and wormwood have long histories in herbal practices for intestinal cleansing, while clove is included for its strong aromatic compounds that support a balanced gut environment.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1528\"><strong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1469\">Storage</strong><br data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1472\">Store in a cool, dark place. Keep bottle tightly sealed.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1924\"><strong data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1614\">Important Notes</strong><br data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1617\">Not for use during pregnancy or breastfeeding. Avoid if you have a history of seizures. Discontinue use if adverse effects occur. Consult a healthcare professional before use if you have any medical condition.</p>",
      "published_at": "2026-04-29T14:23:06-05:00",
      "created_at": "2026-04-29T14:23:06-05:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-04T06:44:36-05:00",
