    {
      "id": 7047751303240,
      "title": "Let That Shit Out Herbal Blend",
      "handle": "let-that-shit-out-herbal-blend",
      "body_html": "<p data-end=\"181\" data-start=\"160\" data-section-id=\"10268ts\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"181\" data-start=\"166\">INGREDIENTS subject to change at any time.</strong></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"181\" data-start=\"160\" data-section-id=\"10268ts\">This powerful blend includes soothes digestive inflammation and promotes relaxation, stimulates bile flow and eases cramping, reduces bloating and gas while supporting natural movement, warms the digestive tract and encourages healthy transit and acts as a gentle natural laxative, supporting liver function and regularity.</p>\n<p data-end=\"245\" data-start=\"182\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"272\" data-start=\"258\">DIRECTIONS</strong></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"273\">Add <strong data-end=\"286\" data-start=\"277\">1 tsp</strong> to 1 cup hot water.<br data-end=\"309\" data-start=\"306\">Steep <strong data-end=\"332\" data-start=\"315\">10\u201315 minutes</strong>, strain, and drink.</p>\n<p data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"273\"><strong>1 cup daily, as needed for digestive support.</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"273\">Store in a cool, dry place away from light.</p>\n<p data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"273\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"512\" data-start=\"498\">DISCLAIMER</strong></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"513\">This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.<br data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"591\">Consult a healthcare professional if pregnant, nursing, or on medication.</p>",
