    {
      "id": 7047506624584,
      "title": "Gut Blanket",
      "handle": "coffee-and-tea-example-product-1",
      "body_html": "<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"127\"><strong data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"127\">Slippery Elm &amp; Marshmallow Root Soothing Blend</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"442\">A gentle, grounding herbal blend traditionally used to support and comfort the digestive and respiratory systems. Slippery elm and marshmallow root are both known for their naturally soothing, mucilage-rich properties that coat and calm irritated tissues, making this blend a staple for everyday wellness rituals.</p>\n<p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"564\">This formula is ideal for those seeking gentle internal support, especially when the body needs a soft, nurturing touch.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"248b9x\" data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"586\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"586\">Key Benefits</strong></span></h3>\n<p>Traditionally used to soothe and calm the digestive tract</p>\n<p>Supports a healthy, comfortable gut environment</p>\n<p>Naturally rich in plant mucilage that helps coat and protect internal tissues</p>\n<p>Gentle support for throat and respiratory comfort</p>\n<p>Ideal for sensitive systems and daily wellness routines</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tuq3va\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"917\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"917\">How to Take</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1051\">Add 1 teaspoon to 8\u201312 oz of water and refrigerate overnight.</p>\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1051\">Add 1 teaspoon to 8\u201312 oz of warm (not hot) water and stir well. Let sit for 2\u20133 minutes to activate the natural mucilage, then drink slowly.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1066\">Can be taken:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1160\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1vifie6\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1096\">1\u20132 times daily as needed</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"gey38d\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1160\">Best taken between meals or before bed for soothing support</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1241\"><em data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1241\">Mix thoroughly\u2014this blend naturally thickens when activated with liquid.</em></p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1byumnk\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1262\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1262\">Ingredients</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1314\">Organic Slippery Elm Bark, Organic Marshmallow Root</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cvq8f\" data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1337\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1337\">Wellness Note</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1496\">Use within three days. This is a traditional herbal preparation used for centuries in herbal wellness practices. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>",
