    {
      "id": 7047506788424,
      "title": "Apex Trio Tincture",
      "handle": "coffee-and-tea-example-product-2",
      "body_html": "<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"140\">Black Walnut Hull + Wormwood + Clove</p>\n<p data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"477\">A traditional herbal extract formulated with three powerful botanicals historically used to support intestinal cleansing and microbial balance. This concentrated tincture is designed to complement gut protocols by helping create an internal environment that is less hospitable to unwanted organisms while supporting digestive function.</p>\n<p data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"558\"><strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"494\">Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"497\">Black walnut hull, wormwood, clove, alcohol (extraction base)</p>\n<p data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"752\">Take <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"624\">10\u201315 drops in water 2 times daily or 15\u201330 drops in water 1 time daily.</strong><br data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"628\">Start with <strong data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"661\">5 drops once daily</strong> to assess tolerance, then increase as needed.<br data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\">Take on an empty stomach or between meals.</p>\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"957\">This traditional trio works together to provide targeted herbal support:</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"992\">Supports parasite cleansing</strong> using botanicals historically used for intestinal organisms</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1087\">Promotes microbial balance</strong> within the digestive tract</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1159\">Provides concentrated herbal potency</strong> in an easy-to-use liquid form</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1225\">Supports digestive function</strong> during cleansing protocols</p>\n<p data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1451\">Black walnut hull and wormwood have long histories in herbal practices for intestinal cleansing, while clove is included for its strong aromatic compounds that support a balanced gut environment.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1528\"><strong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1469\">Storage</strong><br data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1472\">Store in a cool, dark place. Keep bottle tightly sealed.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1588\"><strong data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1544\">Shelf Life</strong><br data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1547\">Up to <strong data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1566\">2\u20133 years</strong> when stored properly.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1924\"><strong data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1614\">Important Notes</strong><br data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1617\">Not for use during pregnancy or breastfeeding. Avoid if you have a history of seizures, liver conditions, or are taking psychiatric or seizure medications. Discontinue use if adverse effects occur. Consult a healthcare professional before use if you have any medical condition.</p>",
