    {
      "id": 7047506952264,
      "title": "Parasite Buster",
      "handle": "coffee-and-tea-example-product-3",
      "body_html": "<p data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"105\"><strong data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"105\">Seed Cleanse Powder Blend</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"445\">A traditional, food-based blend of nutrient-dense seeds crafted to support gut health, digestion, and the body\u2019s natural ability to eliminate unwanted organisms. This formula combines fiber-rich and botanically active seeds to help create an intestinal environment that is less supportive of parasites while promoting regular elimination.</p>\n<p data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"576\"><strong data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"462\">Ingredients are subject to change at any time</strong><br data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"465\">Pumpkin seed, flax seed, chia seed, hulled sesame seed, fennel seed, dried papaya seed, black cumin seed and clove.</p>\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1083\">This blend works through a combination of mechanical cleansing and traditional herbal support:</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1118\">Supports parasite cleansing</strong> by helping create an intestinal environment that is less hospitable to unwanted organisms</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1237\">Promotes elimination</strong> with natural fiber to help move waste through the digestive tract</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1332\">Supports gut balance</strong> by combining seeds traditionally used for digestive and microbial support</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1451\">Helps reduce bloating and discomfort</strong> with fennel and fiber-rich ingredients</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1523\">Provides mineral support</strong> for overall gut and immune health</p>\n<p>Take <strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"636\">1 teaspoon once daily with food</strong> (breakfast or lunch). Mix into applesauce, yogurt, oatmeal, or a smoothie and drink a full glass of water.<br data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"746\">If sensitive, start with <strong data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"810\">1/2 teaspoon for the first 2\u20133 days</strong>, then increase to 1 teaspoon daily as tolerated.</p>",
