      "id": 7047562330184,
      "title": "Sacred Cooling Tea",
      "handle": "example-product-copy",
      "body_html": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A traditional herbal blend crafted to support the body during fever by promoting gentle sweating, easing discomfort, calming the nervous system, and helping the body move through the fever cycle more comfortably.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span><strong>Ingredients: Subject to Change at any time<br></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span>Achillea millefolium, Mentha piperita, Cymbopogon citratus, Zingiber officinale, Nepeta cataria</span><span></span></p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong><span>Directions:</span></strong><br><span>Add 1 teaspoon of tea blend to 1 cup of hot water. Cover and steep for 10\u201315 minutes. Strain and enjoy warm. Use up to 2\u20133 times daily as needed.</span></p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong><span>Caution:</span></strong><br><span>Do not use if pregnant or nursing. Consult a healthcare professional before use if taking blood thinners, or. Not intended for young children without professional guidance.</span></p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong><span>Storage:</span></strong><br><span>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Disclaimer:</span></strong><br><span>These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</span></p>",
